WEBVTT

00:20:27.996 --> 00:20:32.996
decisions that might be taken within
an organization or a decision that

00:20:32.996 --> 00:20:37.954
an interviewer might take in deciding
whether or not to hire a candidate.

00:20:38.579 --> 00:20:42.496
And he had the advice of delaying
intuition is simply

00:20:42.496 --> 00:20:45.579
because when you have formed an intuition,

00:20:46.246 --> 00:20:48.288
you are no longer taking in information.

00:20:49.038 --> 00:20:51.496
You are just rationalizing
your own decision

00:20:51.788 --> 00:20:53.788
or you're confirming your own decision.

00:20:53.913 --> 00:20:59.204
And there is a lot of research indicating
that this is actually what happens

00:20:59.204 --> 00:21:02.413
in interviews, that interviewers
spend a lot of time.